  "published": "2026-09-28T06:28:53.98Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.6: output as Microsoft Report Viewer renders it, checked against Report Viewer 15.0.1404.0's own renders: charts, gauges and maps laid out and drawn as Report Viewer draws them (series of different types in one chart, secondary value axes, funnel and pyramid charts, pie labels, SSRS's label keywords), their text measured and placed as GDI+ places it; lines break and fold where Report Viewer breaks them; images sized, tiled and sampled as their Sizing says and as GDI+ draws them; dashed and dotted borders as Report Viewer draws them; image output on GDI+'s pixel grid; times with a plain space before AM and PM. Behavior change: a Format on a textbox's Style is ignored, as Report Viewer ignores it (move it onto the text run). Details: https://ssrs2.net",
